@graham.bloice -  Latest patchset compiled cleanly on macOS.  As you guessed, I had previously ran Wireshark out of the build folder.

After a few false starts[1] I was able build a macOS installer. The *.dmg file was copied over to another macOS system and installed. On this other macOS system the SparkPlugB dissector was verified to work.

[1] FWIW: My relatively new macOS dev VM didn't have the `dmgbuild` tool installed.  I had to `pip3 install dmgbuild` and `pip3 install biplist` before I could get the `ninja dmg_package` to complete successfully.

